## Communications
## MOF Catalysts
Detox, faster than fast: Chemical-warfare agents including nerve agents are threat to humans. A six-connected zirconium metal–organic framework (MOF) can hydrolyze a nerve-agent simulant within 30 s which is faster than any other catalysts reported. It is a promising material for protective equipment as well as the elimination of large stores of nerve agents.
